schway-screen 1
screen approval-edit
title Approve an edit
description The exact clamp replacement is previewed before approval.
variant light-80
size 80x30
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
 ⚡ schway  ~/demo

   Allow edit? · ask mode

   clamp.ts  +1 −1
   2 │-  return Math.max(lo, n);
   2 │+  return Math.min(hi, Math.max(lo, n));













